& [P6MultiSurfaceProjectionEnvelopeAndSurfaceSpecificBoundaryContractV1] is the P6-S03 multi-surface projection envelope and surface-specific boundary contract
  + [slice_id] is P6-S03
  + [slice_name] is multi-surface projection envelope and surface-specific boundary contract
  + [model_route_used] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_depth] is deeper_reasoning_required
  + [model_route_reason] is surface-specific boundaries determine what each conversation surface may show, request, or classify without becoming authority
  + [contract_result] is multi_surface_projection_envelope_defined_without_surface_implementation
  + [next_gate_result] is P6-S04 may open
  + [projection_fixture_file_creation_authorized] is false
  + [expected_snapshot_creation_authorized] is false
  + [generated_projection_creation_authorized] is false
  + [implementation_code_authorized] is false
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [transport_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [UI_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [assignment_authorized] is false
  + [dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: define the common projection envelope and surface-specific boundaries only
  = must: preserve P6-S02 authority notice, freshness, nonpromotion, stop-state, handoff, and refusal semantics on every decision-making projection
  = must: treat every named surface as a carrier or projection family, not a source authority store, assignment engine, dispatch engine, operations controller, or live-control route

& [P6CommonProjectionEnvelope] is the common envelope required for every P6 surface projection
  + [required_field] is projection_id
  + [required_field] is projection_uuid
  + [required_field] is projection_kind
  + [required_field] is surface_family
  + [required_field] is carrier_surface
  + [required_field] is projected_subject_ref
  + [required_field] is source_record_ref_set
  + [required_field] is source_authority_sha256_set
  + [required_field] is lineage_edge_set
  + [required_field] is authority_notice_ref
  + [required_field] is freshness_state
  + [required_field] is projected_status
  + [required_field] is stop_state_ref_set
  + [required_field] is nonpromotion_notice_set
  + [required_field] is supported_action_route_set
  + [required_field] is forbidden_action_set
  + [required_field] is mutation_boundary_ref
  + [required_field] is carrier_context_ref
  + [required_field] is generated_at
  + [required_field] is invalidation_ref_set
  + [surface_family] is manager
  + [surface_family] is worker
  + [surface_family] is narrative
  + [surface_family] is debug
  + [surface_family] is chat
  + [surface_family] is Codex
  + [surface_family] is terminal
  + [surface_family] is IRC
  + [surface_family] is Matrix
  + [surface_family] is web
  + [surface_family] is Langflow

  = must: keep projection identity distinct from source record identity
  = must: require the same authority notice and freshness semantics across compact and verbose surfaces
  = must: block any projection family that cannot preserve required envelope fields or visible stop-state evidence

